{"post": true, "caption": "Missing a move costs you nothing. Chasing it can cost you your edge.\nWhen you chase, the stop still belongs where the setup fails. So the risk grows and the reward shrinks.\nIf the entry is gone, the trade is gone. Let the next setup come to you.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #TradingPsychology #FOMO #TradingDiscipline #RiskReward", "tag": "MINDSET", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 92, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 140, "lines": [{"t": "MISSED IT?", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "GOOD.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "Chasing costs", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "more than missing.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Here's the proof.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 5.5, "title": "Same trade. Same stop.", "subtitle": "reward vs risk, entry 100 vs 104", "rows": [{"l": "Planned entry", "v": 3, "vl": "3 : 1", "lc": "fg", "bc": "green"}, {"l": "Chased entry", "v": 0.33, "vl": "1 : 3", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 3.0, "label": "chasing the same move", "value": "3x RISK", "note": "For one third the reward.", "c": "red", "size": 150}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 90, "lines": [{"t": "FOMO says now.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Your plan says wait.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.6, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "Missed the bus?", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "Don't chase it", "c": "red"}, {"t": "into traffic.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Another one comes.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.2, "size": 96, "lines": [{"t": "No setup.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "No trade.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "Trade with a system, not a feeling."}]}